  "body": "(This post was initially empty, but to summarize the changes, added a check list)\n- [x] sync the spec text with the new reference implementation\n- [ ] ~~merge ReadableStreamController and ReadableByteStreamController~~\n- [ ] merge ReadableStreamReader and ReadableByteStreamBYOBReader\n- [ ] https://github.com/whatwg/streams/issues/423\n  - [x] add byobRequest getter to the controller\n  - [ ] ~~adopt the while-loop based pulling routine for the non-byte source version~~\n  - [ ] ~~stop delaying pull based on the return value of the last pull call~~\n- [x] port the asserts in the non-byte source version to the byte source version\n- [x] remove auto release feature from the byte source version\n- [x] rename Byob to BYOB\n- [x] move TransferArrayBuffer to helpers.js\n- [x] make the default highWaterMark of the byte source version to 0\n- [x] port the functionality that the start method can delay pulling by returning a pending Promise to the byte source version\n- [x] add `[[disturbed]]` feature to the byte source version\n- [x] port highWaterMark mechanism to ReadableByteStreamController\n- [x] merge ReadableStream and ReadableByteStream\n  - now it behaves differently based on whether the given source has pullInto or not\n  - [x] bunch of renaming for merge\n- [x] merge ReadableStreamReader and ReadableByteStreamReader\n- [x] https://github.com/whatwg/streams/issues/424\n  - [x] make controller.close() and controller.enqueue() fail when the stream is not in the readable state\n  - [x] make controller.enqueue() throw a predefined TypeError, not the stored error\n- [x] Rename ReadableStreamController to ReadableStreamDefaultController\n- [x] Rename ReadableStreamReader to ReadableStreamDefaultReader\n- [x] Rename ReadableByteStreamController to ReadableStreamBYOBController\n",
